      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Email Enquiries Only**\r\n\r\nDoran Estates are delighted to present this bright and well-proportioned one-bedroom apartment to the Dublin 7 rental market. Located in the well-established Smithfield Gate development, just off North King Street, this apartment offers comfortable accommodation in a highly convenient city-centre location.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, a separate kitchen with a serving hatch connecting to the dining and living area, one generous double bedroom and a family bathroom.\r\nThe main living space is a particular highlight, with floor-to-ceiling windows allowing an abundance of natural light to fill the room. This creates a bright, airy and welcoming space for both relaxing and dining.\r\nThe apartment is ideally located for enjoying everything Smithfield and Stoneybatter have to offer, with a wide selection of cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday amenities all within easy walking distance. Dublin city centre is also easily accessible, with O’Connell Street, Henry Street and Grafton Street all within convenient reach.\r\nExcellent transport links are another major benefit, with both the Red and Green LUAS lines within walking distance. TU Dublin Grangegorman is also nearby, while the central location provides easy access to the wider city and surrounding areas.\r\nThis is a well-located apartment offering bright living accommodation in one of Dublin 7’s most convenient areas.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the excellent location, natural light and overall presentation of this apartment."
      },
